<title>NIGERIA: Chevron Nigeria gets new chief executive.</title>
<headline>Chevron Nigeria gets new chief executive.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-10-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chevron Corp has named a new chief executive for its Nigerian operations, the company said in a statement on Saturday.</p>
<p>It said George Kirkland, 46, a professional civil engineer would replace William Edman effective from November 1.</p>
<p>&quot;Edman, Kirkland's predecessor, is heading for Canada where he will assume duty as President, Chevron Canada Resources (CCR), the Calgary-based subsidiary,&quot; it added.</p>
<p>Chevron is a major oil production and exploration operator in Nigeria.</p>
<p>--Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
